#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:10002
#: 1bcbfa86447b492aaa9360f88c4dd60b
msgid "Control Analysis: Resonance and Feedback Basics"
msgstr "制御解析: 共振とフィードバックの基礎"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:20002
#: d4dd455b53d4439496981b18b5a01b65
msgid ""
"This notebook turns the legacy control measurement tutorial into a public "
"control-analysis entrypoint. The core question is how to recognize a "
"resonant plant from time-series data before any controller is designed."
msgstr ""
"この notebook は legacy の計測・スペクトル解析チュートリアルを、公開 docs "
"用に共振解析の入口として整理したものです。コントローラを設計する前に知りたいのは、**どこに共振があり、入力が本当に出力を説明しているか** です。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:20004
#: d34fc6e4f3174a39b8fd68317e738a7d
msgid ""
"We use a broadband drive, a second-order plant, ASD, coherence, and a "
"measured transfer function. Those are the measurements that tell you whether"
" the mode is real, where it sits, and whether the input truly explains the "
"output."
msgstr "広帯域励振、ASD、コヒーレンス、伝達関数を並べることで、その判断に必要な 3 つの情報を同時に見ます。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:40002
#: a8996fab7e534fb9872beb350374dfbd
msgid "1. Inspect the time series"
msgstr "1. 時間波形を見る"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:40004
#: 530d72e737724b79af1e1c6568f61ea8
msgid ""
"A short zoom shows that the output is not just delayed input: it rings "
"because energy is temporarily stored in the resonant mode."
msgstr "短時間のズームでは、出力が単なる遅れた入力ではなく、共振モードにエネルギーが一時的に蓄えられていることが見えます。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:60002
#: 478c9898fe1a42b19f8765d6e2bee562
msgid "2. ASD, coherence, and measured transfer function"
msgstr "2. ASD・コヒーレンス・伝達関数"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_basics.ipynb:60004
#: 691375c76ff64ec29d5d8dc279102664
msgid ""
"ASD shows where energy accumulates, coherence shows whether the drive really"
" explains the response, and the transfer function combines both into the "
"plant's complex frequency response."
msgstr "ASD はどこにエネルギーが集まるか、コヒーレンスは入力がどこまで出力を説明しているか、伝達関数はその両方をまとめた複素応答です。"
